# Some Additional Proposals.

**Authors:** Gans, Herbert J.

## Abstract
Expands Elihu Katz's proposals for social research on broadcasting with suggestions for &quot;decentering&quot; the media, studying the effects of society on the media, and looking at what researchers do to, for, and against television and its viewers. (JMF)

